abstract: >-
  The TronMake Genome Lib Builder system is leveraged for
  preparing a reference genome and annotation set for use
  with SnakeMake and NextFlow based pipelines, including
  cancer-specific alternative splicing and somatic mutation
  discovery. The genome resource building process creates a
  unified annotation set based on GENCODE reference
  annotation and the GATK resource bundle (hg38).
